# Cloudflare Pages response headers (copied into the build output; see docs/architecture.md → Hosting).
# Page and data must revalidate on every visit: the data processes commit several times a day.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
